"⟪k:0⟫Riding the moonlight’s current, his hand fell against my cheek.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was much colder "
"than I had expected,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Facendosi guidare dalla corrente della luna, la sua mano si posò sulla mia guancia.⟪k:1⟫ Era "
"molto più fredda di quanto mi aspettassi,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E05F5ED4_80BB_4F67_9BDF_F9C180B1D998
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8cf908b3f17a68913fe0753386af760a6487301d050cc0696509826c58dd2cc
