#: scenario5:scenario5_5830D3A1_ED90_4E29_A470_5E0F68FAD0F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4053bb8c8da37023ac8a1446ddf44aeeef00b1a466e8f3fb73936dfe59d97b48
