msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5830D3A1_ED90_4E29_A470_5E0F68FAD0F7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was stunning. ⟪k:1⟫I had no measure of comparison, but I was certain the same sight of "
"any other woman in the world would not have had the same effect on me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era stupenda. ⟪k:1⟫Non avevo mezzi di paragone, ma ero sicuro che la vista di qualunque "
"altra donna al mondo non avrebbe mai avuto lo stesso effetto su di me."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DD70090B_97AB_4162_B856_5740FC5490D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0aea2619ff899ecc76d0d9385b0dc838c3a1d9e1b13aa778dc469fe6bc8d3b0
