msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DD70090B_97AB_4162_B856_5740FC5490D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could say as much with confidence, despite having never seen another woman nude. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Hypnotized, I couldn’t take my eyes off the gentle curves of her body."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Potevo dirlo con estrema fiducia, nonostante non avessi mai visto nessun’altra donna nuda. "
"⟪k:1⟫Ero ipnotizzato; non riuscivo a distogliere⟪k:2⟫lo sguardo dalle dolci curve del suo corpo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B47F71BB_ADA2_4C71_855D_BDAB44D59A21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35998f69505764c934cfc8c35eb727733b1e329513545607b121c35fd5f2c803
