msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B47F71BB_ADA2_4C71_855D_BDAB44D59A21"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Were I more socially inclined, perhaps I could have told her she was pretty, which perhaps "
"would have brought a sheepish smile to her face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se fossi stato più disinvolto, forse avrei potuto dirle che era graziosa,⟪k:1⟫al che lei "
"avrebbe probabilmente sorriso con imbarazzo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_61584666_3504_460C_9867_85DF4F95FDF1
