msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Ahh, so ⟪k:1⟫that’s⟪k:2⟫ why she said I would have to see them eventually...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Ah, quindi è per ⟪k:1⟫questo⟪k:2⟫ che ha detto che avrei dovuto vederle in ogni caso...)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_55C88ACA_340B_4D9F_BCE4_3EB7415B16CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ffd476f6fce9e9dfe32311fa50c14e09d9de403c155056a7e666852673d28f6
