msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_337DF814_E1AC_4B07_A640_6BC1D14477E4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt nauseous. ⟪k:1⟫Heartbroken. ⟪k:2⟫Infuriated.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫At the fact that the person who "
"had done this was out of my reach.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫At the fact that I could do nothing for her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mi sentivo disgustato. ⟪k:1⟫Affranto. ⟪k:2⟫Infuriato.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Per il fatto che la persona "
"che le aveva fatto quello era fuori dalla mia portata.⟪k:5⟫ Per il fatto che non potevo fare "
"nulla per lei."

#: scenario5:scenario5_96F9440B_9DEF_4B86_8826_22C98E0A04AB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7aa430c498e4f428506b79227cf4dde761e38d5d8ac27cb75dfed03f62e31f96
