msgid "⟪k:0⟫What did he gain from giving her these wounds?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Cosa ci aveva guadagnato provocandole quelle ferite?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6143A44C_037A_4997_95C7_39D26F7FECBC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
