msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why my father, of all people?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Perché mio padre, tra tutte le persone?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_06E0553F_3A5D_4B6D_93C6_3F4C1F8842AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
