msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Giselle was the one with the scars. ⟪k:1⟫Giselle was the one in pain.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫But I felt "
"like someone had shoved a handful of needles into my chest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era Giselle quella con le cicatrici. ⟪k:1⟫Era Giselle quella che soffriva.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ma in "
"quel momento ero io a sentirmi trafitto da una montagna di aghi."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0C177F9E_07A4_43C1_A7CD_0D46AC99396C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f19401055c87dc669903b61a056b0c54983c226db76ac61d3d11f5fbe752690a
