msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What was the right thing to say? What was I supposed to tell her?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As hard as I "
"thought, I couldn’t come up with an answer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Qual era la cosa giusta da dire? Cos’avrei dovuto dirle?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Per quanto pensassi, non "
"riuscivo a trovare una risposta."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A84205E9_8A98_4013_BA85_DFC6FF2A8E09
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd319897eeb304a36213a94e961515d98288908786b60d7fee9186a6ff6f25c6
