msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Vorresti maledire Antonin?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_02B8F237_E207_4C51_B8CF_7274CF68EF06
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbdaef1cd70e9660f0bcf04199c80fecbcfd13c5475247607efd99196d019f5b
