#: scenario5:scenario5_631F0C07_5F95_460D_BBB4_AC2544FE3675
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd79f61c01915d86cd4e997fa35fd985d2c8514ce06843c708175800a4559ac5
#. default-sha256: f2b498517068e30ab83fb35b0dfe1b2004cc71f15a5983c5a4b31917ddb806ac
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_631F0C07_5F95_460D_BBB4_AC2544FE3675"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I want you to be honest with me. ⟪k:1⟫If, hypothetically,⟪k:2⟫such a thing were possible, "
"would you want to curse him?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Voglio che tu sia sincera con me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se, ipoteticamente, una cosa del genere fosse "
"possibile,⟪k:3⟫vorresti maledirlo?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_40A4CAD5_9803_4131_9C9B_F403C9431437
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b06657f31411fa4185d2c95fd66426ba692ba01389483d5fe4643b8ef36fc807
#. default-sha256: 7e54e6f854cc2e104bcf3236cf5c0e3c8e32e17e5381391b1393848f5a9c6da6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_40A4CAD5_9803_4131_9C9B_F403C9431437"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫...No, I would not want that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫...No, non vorrei farlo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_624A38E4_B8E8_4A96_8D5F_55C759B15018
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b76819302beab0c3743ce36a16b42c68aac36e887ae3b0f66b90519314ed1d1
#. default-sha256: e49ce8dae724647d10f40438757de47701580e12de660a136080f8416be015e1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_624A38E4_B8E8_4A96_8D5F_55C759B15018"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Why not? ⟪k:1⟫You have every right to take revenge.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫For what that man did... "
"⟪k:4⟫he ⟪k:5⟫deserves⟪k:6⟫ punishment!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Perché no? ⟪k:1⟫Hai tutto il diritto di vendicarti.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Quell’uomo ⟪k:4⟫merita⟪k:5⟫ "
"di essere punito per ciò che ha fatto!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5C1270ED_BD5C_428B_81E0_586D7F55FFAE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8dfd9bc0acbc92a7ffd83419bca8daad9027b6b6241ef2d850d45b588dc032a7
#. default-sha256: ba584166413707207c352d89cb325d44d118a383e8e94d1f1789d06d268abcd9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5C1270ED_BD5C_428B_81E0_586D7F55FFAE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He inflicted so much pain on you!⟪k:1⟫You’re still shaking, more than a year later!⟪k:2⟫And "
"you can just let him get away with it out of the goodness of your heart?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ti ha provocato così tanto dolore!⟪k:1⟫Stai ancora tremando, dopo più di un anno!⟪k:2⟫E tu "
"vuoi lasciarlo stare solo perché sei una donna di buon cuore?!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8E94E79F_2A1D_44E4_A18A_1F6E16E386F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a4c19f8bc3c3d527ac26f93ca8da5ce0fe6ec4108d9f564429a3a20104ab5a3
#. default-sha256: b117fa3f17405fd2a5c6b0f8d38e415f868005ccff00028864f8f8aa9027feaf
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8E94E79F_2A1D_44E4_A18A_1F6E16E386F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hypothetically!⟪k:2⟫ If you wanted to curse him, I—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ipoteticamente!⟪k:2⟫ Se avessi voluto maledirlo, io—!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_00B4C34E_7151_4532_9C5B_7DD2F18BBA71
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5237fb346b1445e369f575a91fcb4e8527af74cbde261b3038a23e996bfaae45
#. default-sha256: 9cb9e674d198a44964bcd274799a5d54eeed5b51142d6710a2bfa9d6ab25954b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_00B4C34E_7151_4532_9C5B_7DD2F18BBA71"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wouldn’t do it even hypothetically.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And not... ⟪k:3⟫out of the goodness of my "
"heart.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I’m just a coward."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non lo farei nemmeno ipoteticamente.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E non... ⟪k:3⟫per il mio essere di buon cuore."
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ma perché sono una codarda."

#: scenario5:scenario5_555E6BA8_85C3_4325_BCE8_F0242592924A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6dd2f66d7d9c907220a5084021b2c7df1c81d2b725e76a1874bb6a41ac276da
#. default-sha256: 7c3459ec6a5c3561e315896dcaffd45bb0d29ad9a3dd27421fd79e486e16c4ce
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_555E6BA8_85C3_4325_BCE8_F0242592924A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A... ⟪k:1⟫coward?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Una... ⟪k:1⟫codarda?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B81AFD1E_DF1C_4CB4_9526_D9EF5B378135
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13942445663b26e724f367523a4eebf463b4fa01d2118c3937ebd6bdfeb38b2b
#. default-sha256: d6cfcf3654d8bd3582200e72b276046fde29333ea3929c26820712bf5cd953b5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B81AFD1E_DF1C_4CB4_9526_D9EF5B378135"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If curses ⟪k:1⟫were⟪k:2⟫ real, and he were to die by one,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Se le maledizioni fossero ⟪k:1⟫reali⟪k:2⟫, e lui morisse a causa loro,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2C03D6B1_1EBA_4090_BF12_97222E38BB16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d4562d18561d33cb9ec80de6dda103e65c35e8c87cbb5d1fe6512741fba3304
#. default-sha256: c13785dcc0357a206a86e3d288e924901f3084cac69f29626fc59a11d29813e5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2C03D6B1_1EBA_4090_BF12_97222E38BB16"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫then I would never, ⟪k:1⟫ever⟪k:2⟫ be able to forget.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫If my resentment for him took "
"his life,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫allora non riuscirei ⟪k:1⟫mai e poi mai⟪k:2⟫ a dimenticare.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Se il mio rancore nei "
"suoi confronti gli togliesse la vita,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_85FC680D_8E14_48B2_86A4_3B629B5E75F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16730002ce9bb81f65f14ecfa74959a4f174777a58dd23ff0c128d2c199a96f7
#. default-sha256: e0573b3273197bb50a328fdc68474d9be3c5b897e7dd42cd8b3c7580d8f8b98b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_85FC680D_8E14_48B2_86A4_3B629B5E75F2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫that would mean he had damaged me so permanently I was never able to get past it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫vorrebbe dire che mi avrebbe fatto talmente male da non riuscire più⟪k:1⟫a superarlo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9EED34B2_7659_48AF_BCF1_63E3BC12D403
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86599fd78cd901368061cb8cc2bbf19b98afafb801c5fd4dce7121e2761881e0
#. default-sha256: 23b9fa29cb00a61967d98e297b3ba89391551fca54c42fe98af6bdd9c9bcb7d7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9EED34B2_7659_48AF_BCF1_63E3BC12D403"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I don’t want that.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I ⟪k:3⟫want⟪k:4⟫ to be able to forget."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E io non voglio questo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Voglio ⟪k:3⟫riuscire⟪k:4⟫ a dimenticare."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5CC8AFD9_1813_4A01_8031_92E27EFF7280
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 362f71efded4871b9fe52fd7a8462a78dc159411f0f9cddefa8aed77d27834b3
#. default-sha256: 8cbed4b031e3ad26fba9d5d5ba1edeb15686807579b4c66fc94243bb679a32e6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5CC8AFD9_1813_4A01_8031_92E27EFF7280"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m still shaking now...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but one day, I want to be able to proclaim,⟪k:3⟫proudly, "
"that it no longer has any control over me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sto tremando tuttora...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ma un giorno, voglio arrivare al punto da poter dichiarare "
"con fierezza che non ha più alcun controllo su di me."

#: scenario5:scenario5_189EF050_DBC6_4845_B1E2_D1B2EAA912AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3f2f1fff0c89b4aa57c6a950aaae1b4e27510f534fd7279dbc41dc0df26d1bf
