msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_502BA41C_AA95_42BB_826E_23C3721818E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3718957fd1344abdc1a080c54f6ee6e78b34d8230502fa95c52ded46467ea71
#. default-sha256: d2de737f6574836fe30423a0ca90a6d050b6baa7c969d3c0488e19d0a66f8cd7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_502BA41C_AA95_42BB_826E_23C3721818E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫But I appreciate the sentiment.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫Setting aside your choice of method..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Ma apprezzo il pensiero.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫A "
"prescindere dal modo..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_EBDC2BF5_6E78_45FB_BA22_EBA0A010DB03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6849845e16405365ae58dabbad348c44abc676b0a311b0b0ae90661289ad114c
#. default-sha256: c46e017f49e1999a9be6bb3d8c4978b5c90cb0686daf023f19029e8334ebedbf
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EBDC2BF5_6E78_45FB_BA22_EBA0A010DB03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫you asked out of concern, and that’s more than enough for me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫me l’hai chiesto spinto dalla preoccupazione,⟪k:1⟫e questo per me è più che sufficiente."

#: scenario5:scenario5_297134E5_8E5B_45E6_BE7F_EE96BEC739E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 089826a98010b90bf1f76b03fcc7474532cb24f0e8ae118d78081f765fd8496e
#. default-sha256: 71fe02357e12eea7e51a75a83d81a2243ceeddf343fa0c52ef43da63fe5e44b2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_297134E5_8E5B_45E6_BE7F_EE96BEC739E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A soft smile spread across her lips, but all it inspired in me was powerlessness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sulle sue labbra si formò un timido sorriso, ma tutto ciò che mi suscitava era impotenza."

#: scenario5:scenario5_3A092EBD_F1E9_47E8_AFE9_5459AD2E4A21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90c6ab3033cd92db856cf8666494641a0b078fecbb5d3f1815eed723d15052e1
#. default-sha256: f37cdf5123aa2d5caeb2c53e9616eb958d88e3939f1da7da60fb5077bb2a7edb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3A092EBD_F1E9_47E8_AFE9_5459AD2E4A21"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was putting on an act. ⟪k:1⟫Was the sentiment really “more than enough”?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Stava fingendo. ⟪k:1⟫Il pensiero era davvero “più che sufficiente”?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_033764A7_4DD9_4F33_B798_CC908375A9FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a03e9093dd102802c69a96e561f688f0dd885f76b75ae65b87053c4f10724735
#. default-sha256: 63d87677d71408321af4b05e0468ab1a1504fe9c9bfe6bcc3224b233566c61a4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_033764A7_4DD9_4F33_B798_CC908375A9FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Of course not. ⟪k:1⟫Not when she was still trembling so much.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫But what was I to do?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Certo che no. ⟪k:1⟫Non quando stava ancora tremando così tanto.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ma cosa potevo fare?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7630CDDD_D507_4DDC_9DE5_AB55970B9303
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d4b08d53038a399f84cca217ef646288d6513e657c61fcd4141d8805672b3d9
#. default-sha256: c3320d5ac3b826e94e79c7926aedd54eb68969f58733d714d2eab2ce716b5a0b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7630CDDD_D507_4DDC_9DE5_AB55970B9303"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What was I—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫unable to leave this house and helpless against the will of the "
"Bollingers—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫to do?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Io che non potevo lasciare quella casa, io che ero inerme di fronte al volere dei "
"Bollinger... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫cosa potevo fare?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3248D2FD_049C_445F_88A2_65E1956C5FEA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96eb5e26f322081f4c35c6bfdd669feddc02e12418d279d709b35a5809e05921
#. default-sha256: 78beaa0e78763f3407aca6d4df3734730b682842e69faafa9e3364fb3dbf90a6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3248D2FD_049C_445F_88A2_65E1956C5FEA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was incapable of assuaging her pain, wasn’t I?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ero incapace di lenire il suo dolore, giusto?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6A8E4156_6BDE_4791_8E65_71090127264B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06f48c7e7bcd8097d68cf253f493510c3e75c59cb73c765a8a890396efe40dc4
#. default-sha256: 42a638ea85569b2afcbed99825231a3a5ee0ed5ee36bfb9ae3eb0c22898707dd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6A8E4156_6BDE_4791_8E65_71090127264B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t do anything,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non c’era nulla che potessi fare,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8BB3BF4C_732B_4C1D_953A_E9A1CEDC2122
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
