msgstr "⟪k:0⟫—e la stanza venne invasa dal suono del suo pianto."

#: scenario5:scenario5_232D359C_1C5A_4F53_8E21_FC2C227271B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac8d0df0a3c696bef4813634178f5794c07ee697d4b0748302953ebea7cf1966
