msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_232D359C_1C5A_4F53_8E21_FC2C227271B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She cried like a little child. ⟪k:1⟫The usually strong-willed, cheerful, optimistic Giselle "
"wailed from the depths of her soul."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Piangeva come una bambina. ⟪k:1⟫La Giselle risoluta, allegra e ottimista, piangeva dal "
"profondo dell’anima."

#: scenario5:scenario5_318922A9_1AD9_493F_9FB0_08C884701BD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8097f086c7c46547a3db05ff5290fd7b50b75e7e6b1799cf571614e0d2728673
#. default-sha256: 38cb70c3693e983b501476eadba0e79dc5dd38c71d7299607f6ef92159293a9f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_318922A9_1AD9_493F_9FB0_08C884701BD6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This past year, she had constantly been nudging me forward.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was always her "
"leading the way."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Durante l’anno passato, mi aveva costantemente spronato ad andare avanti.⟪k:1⟫ Era sempre "
"stata lei a farmi da guida."

#: scenario5:scenario5_35161B2C_F485_4339_81D8_862AE6A519E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2fb9693e7396e1a436514ffcb0cd2d2d92989c033904083efeb1faada4640cae
