msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_35161B2C_F485_4339_81D8_862AE6A519E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There had, undoubtedly, been moments where she had wanted to cry like this but couldn’t."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Senza dubbio c’erano stati momenti in cui avrebbe voluto piangere allo stesso modo, ma non "
"aveva potuto."

#: scenario5:scenario5_506EC652_7C5A_4E84_BD65_0891E536C4FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c59265c59da4b8a6fc22e75f4903809d65ed2668319057f655c856cba9155c9e
