msgid "⟪k:0⟫So, starting now, I was going to try and support her too."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E così, a partire da quel momento, cercai di sostenerla allo stesso modo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C4C08CE0_0F08_4366_9844_C416D3DD103A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54cd1427ac3a5a6b88c37a7ec12ad9f0bf6e7f9222b548637fed9c3c1ad52f10
