msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C4C08CE0_0F08_4366_9844_C416D3DD103A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was sure I would mess something up, as I had little experience being caring. ⟪k:1⟫I would "
"probably anger her, probably stress her out, and probably make her cry."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ero certo che avrei sbagliato qualcosa, avendo poca esperienza.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫L’avrei "
"probabilmente fatta arrabbiare, l’avrei stressata, o forse⟪k:3⟫l’avrei fatta piangere."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5C27C276_20FF_47C7_BBF5_1D013ADE1DD5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab6afc48c28b0655d0a2f2218a67a3f7ad223bbcf9eb25888c5cc47b48f9ee5b
