msgid "⟪k:0⟫But I had found my resolve. I had overcome my hesitation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma avevo trovato la determinazione. Avevo superato la mia esitazione."

#: scenario5:scenario5_49BEA644_DBAA_4555_B36C_0F6F150DDB36
