msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_18413335_389C_4B6A_9F67_09886BC5243B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Giselle didn’t stop crying until the sun had begun peeking over the horizon. ⟪k:2⟫I "
"had, as I said, not looked away, simply holding her in silence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Giselle non smise di piangere finché il sole non iniziò a spuntare all’orizzonte. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Come già detto, non distolsi lo sguardo; ⟪k:3⟫continuai a stringerla in silenzio."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D8E3B551_A107_4FDB_BBE9_7C0FA718D3A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 627c3e0207c93897f9904369702641b1fe340b184e5ec559d083c3ae7854dff4
