"⟪k:0⟫We felt each other’s warmth through my clothes.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Between sniffles, Giselle said "
"softly,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Potevo percepire il suo calore attraverso i miei vestiti.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tra un sospiro e l’altro, "
"Giselle disse dolcemente,"

